From 6e90cafc1281a5dc70a27ad6f58e5e8a6dd0727d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mohammadzafar Ziya <mohammadzafar.ziya@imgtec.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Feb 2026 11:46:57 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 22/24] pvr: implement u_trace support

Incorporating Markers as a backend for data sources

Implement a gpuvis backend that emits u_trace events to the
Linux ftrace subsystem by writing markers to
/sys/kernel/tracing/trace_marker when built with -Dgpuvis=true.

Trace events can be captured via trace_marker and consumed
in real time through /sys/kernel/tracing/trace_pipe.

Signed-off-by: Mohammadzafar Ziya <mohammadzafar.ziya@imgtec.com>
Reviewed-by: Luigi Santivetti <luigi.santivetti@imgtec.com>
Tested-by: Gyeyoung Baek <gye976@gmail.com>
Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/43853>
(cherry picked from commit c6a1ecc1c987f7fd3d8de244f10f1129baf12f7b)
